    'body'        => <<<'HTML'
<p>Texas is one of the best states in the country to run a side hustle. It has several of the largest and fastest-growing metros in the US, a packed calendar of festivals, rodeos and pro sports, two of the world's busiest airport systems, and no state income tax. If you are trying to figure out how to make extra money in Texas, the real question is which opportunities fit your city, your schedule and your skills. This guide breaks it down by trend and by city, with links to our deeper local guides.</p>

<div class="stat-row">
  <div class="stat"><b>0%</b><span>state income tax</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>15.3%</b><span>federal self-employment tax still applies</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>8.25%</b><span>max combined sales tax rate</span></div>
