    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $15–$30/hr plus tips</li><li><b>Startup:</b> $0</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Seasonal cash</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hustle-card">
    <h3 id="rideshare-airports">Rideshare at big airports</h3>
    <p>DFW, Houston's IAH and Hobby, and Austin-Bergstrom generate long airport trips that pay well. Texas regulates rideshare companies at the state level, so driver requirements are consistent across cities. Combine airport runs with event surge for the best hourly earnings.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $20–$35/hr gross</li><li><b>Startup:</b> Qualifying car</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Early mornings, events</li></ul>
  </div>
