    <h3 id="logistics">Delivery and logistics</h3>
    <p>North Texas is a national warehouse and distribution hub, and Houston's port feeds the same network. Amazon Flex, grocery delivery and courier apps stay busy across the sprawling suburbs where most Texans live.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $15–$25/hr gross</li><li><b>Startup:</b> A car</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Flexible hours</li></ul>
  </div>
