    <h3 id="short-term-rentals">Short-term rental services</h3>
    <p>Austin, the Hill Country, Galveston, South Padre and the coast around Corpus Christi are full of vacation rentals that need turnover cleaning, restocking, laundry and co-hosting. Check city rules, since several Texas cities regulate short-term rentals.</p>
