    <h3 id="remote-skills">Remote and digital skills</h3>
    <p>Texas keeps attracting company relocations and new small businesses, and many need websites, social media, bookkeeping and marketing help. A <a href="/digital-marketing-side-hustle/">digital marketing side hustle</a> or freelancing on Fiverr works anywhere in the state.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $25–$100/hr</li><li><b>Startup:</b> A laptop</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Skilled professionals</li></ul>
