    <h3 id="outdoor-seasonal">Heat, yard and pool work</h3>
    <p>Long Texas summers mean steady demand for lawn mowing, pool cleaning, AC filter changes and pest control helpers. Few people want to work outside in August, which is exactly why it pays.</p>
    <ul class="meta"><li><b>Pay:</b> $25–$50/hr</li><li><b>Startup:</b> Mower or pool kit</li><li><b>Best for:</b> Early risers</li></ul>
